[{"title":"河山","author":"王季珠","text":"忽成忽败古今同，玩弄河山一掌中。\n奋上舞台歌与泣，疲癃何必不英雄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19883,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日喜方耕霞丈见访即以赠别二首 其一","author":"王季珠","text":"顾我来游旧草堂，一杯清茗道家常。\n肝肠甚侠囊偏涩，唇舌无疲剑不芒。\n相必丰颐始有禄，文多激语断非祥。\n评诗莫误诗滋味，满口才教嚼笋香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19884,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日喜方耕霞丈见访即以赠别二首 其二","author":"王季珠","text":"本因作客转称主，才许还乡又别家。\n钜制积成亭畔草，快帆剪碎浪中花。\n老来豪健真难得，事过思量大半差。\n此去虞阳何所颂，颂君一饭一分加。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19885,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"病起二首 其一","author":"王季珠","text":"苦心翻本草，竟尔病魔逃。\n排闼一头颤，披衣两足摇。\n吟情疏欲断，泛梦遣无聊。\n近市偏增恶，人庞语益嚣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19886,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"病起二首 其二","author":"王季珠","text":"文房还怕坐，旧业岂空抛。\n匣墨坚于铁，盆花乱似茅。\n唐娥蚕伏茧，王猛虱扪巢。\n胃气方苏醒，秋菘抵盛殽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19887,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冰箸","author":"王季珠","text":"旷野沙埃不染纤，琼筵高敞制精严。\n未容借拨泥炉火，曾否先尝玉匕盐。\n稚子耐寒排一席，天公表直系重檐。\n双双巧具凭空造，同样心思乃尔尖。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19888,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自题小影","author":"王季珠","text":"呼马呼牛无足异，不仙不佛若何同。\n幕天席地先生笑，算是堂堂一寓公。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19889,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"访相国山居四首 其一","author":"王季珠","text":"封章递进九重门，谪遣还山总主恩。\n一座琴床数笏石，裴公绿野谢公墩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19890,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"访相国山居四首 其二","author":"王季珠","text":"三世儒臣称国老，两朝天子属门生。\n食熊有味何如蛤，好赋梅花续广平。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19891,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"访相国山居四首 其三","author":"王季珠","text":"履厚戴高主眷深，纷纷锦轴积如林。\n寸长尺短非同例，谁为逋臣白此心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19892,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"访相国山居四首 其四","author":"王季珠","text":"庞眉邻叟草衣冠，报道秋成相国欢。\n庚子劫尘飞不到，空山猿鹤梦魂安。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19893,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"诵芬","author":"王季珠","text":"收入图书藏累世，自经劫火杳无踪。\n仅凭父执传佳话，尚忆先人赐笑容。\n船上看山如走马，田间戽水似吟龙。\n千金一腋珍无价，窃恨为裘未善缝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19894,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苏台怀古","author":"王季珠","text":"备荒潘氏井，赡族范公田。\n长此沾遗泽，真能训后贤。\n踉跄千冢鬼，弥际六门烟。\n次第妍花草，吴官尚眼前。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19895,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"广福道中","author":"王季珠","text":"蛇旋曲境路多生，赖有樵儿为导行。\n倒挂虬藤如结采，乱飞翠羽各呼名。\n斯游毕竟关清福，有笔转难写实情。\n步上山头休负异，已登高处一如平。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19896,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谒邓司徒庙","author":"王季珠","text":"瞻拜司徒入社来，清高遗像肖灵台。\n莫嫌香火缘今断，血食绵长万本梅。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19897,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"潘园彭刚直公壁间墨梅","author":"王季珠","text":"荣阳别业草萋萋，败壁犹然见旧题。\n笔下许多刚直气，半由狂醉露端倪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19898,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游圣恩寺登还元阁","author":"王季珠","text":"朝来山气不胜寒，古木长林面面攒。\n旷览太湖三万顷，还元阁上一凭栏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19899,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"石壁精舍","author":"王季珠","text":"高覆松阴复竹阴，窝藏宝刹绝尘侵。\n千寻峭壁俯湖险，一径寒云郁舍深。\n行脚僧忘参上乘，欢颜佛是旧知音。\n重游先与山灵约，容我山巅一鼓琴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19900,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"邓尉探梅","author":"王季珠","text":"生性厌尘俗，绝俗免烦恼。\n而况伏井蛙，怎比离樊鸟。\n年年春及初，邓巅花多少。\n蹑屐陟高岗，仙香袭襟抱。\n系余有所思，路人莫能晓。\n人爱花色佳，花笑人容老。\n少壮曾几时，立业苦不早。\n今日折一枝，还算相逢巧。\n冉冉东皇归，落红无人扫。\n繁华一过眼，徒说虚花好。\n广平赋未裁，和靖诗先草。\n临别各依依，含情莫倾倒。\n既结不解缘，一见缘岂了。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19901,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"穹窿道馆","author":"王季珠","text":"勾吴灵淑气，第一萃穹窿。\n丁井降兵火，茅台唤雨风。\n妙门丹灶辟，仙路白云通。\n推极希夷理，冥冥仰太空。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19902,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"采香径","author":"王季珠","text":"一摘复一摘，蝶引蛾眉走。\n采之欲遗谁，吴王开笑口。\n金粉歇苏堤，五湖渺秋水。\n千载朔风流，人去香留否。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19903,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苏邸寄内","author":"王季珠","text":"客山百里未云遥，每一萦怀万分焦。\n各种象图秋讨晒，将花篱菊早勤浇。\n私仪代我邻翁却，公赋防他悍役骚。\n病里叮咛无别话，卫生第一气和调。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19904,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"留园","author":"王季珠","text":"长留天地愿何宏，园系南州第一工。\n石势轩昂才子气，树容伛偻古稀翁。\n玉池荷卸秋风碧，锦帙书签冷院红。\n晋宋名贤遗手迹，画图早已拓王公。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19905,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"虎邱二首 其一","author":"王季珠","text":"七里陂塘几转湾，画桡光影荡钗环。\n寺门弥勒嫣然笑，竟占风流第一山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19906,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"虎邱二首 其二","author":"王季珠","text":"不波艇子额高楼，唐祝才人此旧游。\n是否生公说法好，隔塘狮子特回头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19907,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"楼观","author":"王季珠","text":"逼近青山势欲吞，旧居灰烬小楼存。\n岫云出是六鳌举，阵雨来如万马奔。\n直北莽苍沙岸树，偏东稠密画图村。\n此身岂受泥涂困，早仗云梯达帝阍。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19908,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"见郁李花感赋以示胞弟","author":"王季珠","text":"草草劳生未有涯，一门四处益堪嗟。\n兵围莫解中年遇，裘敝难缝数口家。\n差为疗贫文短售，甚母染侠酒狂赊。\n同根理合同回护，风雨无伤郁李花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19909,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"假缘山庄落成额堂曰旷庐赋诗志喜","author":"王季珠","text":"手辟山庄号假缘，壬寅乃是落成年。\n堂深燕寄安祥梦，井阔蛙窥广大天。\n扫榻曾留新学士，题楹羞袭旧春联。\n竹头木屑勤收拾，易被旁人笑我颠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19910,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自题懒鸿馆","author":"王季珠","text":"天涯何苦惊征骖，且卸征衣卧一庵。\n赠我异香花美意，觉人浑梦鸟高谈。\n无头巾气赵瓯北，得正乐音陆剑南。\n四辟窗棂光莫借，过庭书谱不时参。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19911,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"莳花木","author":"王季珠","text":"分科班位定，种植费心裁。\n按候疏花性，融泥保命荄。\n技高声价重，果熟俸钱来。\n也似名无竞，春兰入夏开。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19912,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂咏十首 其一","author":"王季珠","text":"万物各有本，培植系乎人。\n何谓真种子，一点核中仁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19913,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂咏十首 其二","author":"王季珠","text":"寿命岂预期，十事九中变。\n隆誉不容赊，行乐且博现。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19914,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂咏十首 其三","author":"王季珠","text":"毒龙受人制，猛虎受人擒。\n智勇俱无用，蛀虫暗生心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19915,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂咏十首 其四","author":"王季珠","text":"鸟语情如诉，蛩吟怨未休。\n若求均苦乐，倒不转春秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19916,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂咏十首 其五","author":"王季珠","text":"先存爱物心，去私不假斧。\n先存爱己心，急公怕闻鼓。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19917,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂咏十首 其六","author":"王季珠","text":"朝生千忆貌，暮化千忆身。\n只此啼与笑，阴阳忙煞人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19918,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂咏十首 其七","author":"王季珠","text":"七情喜居一，六恶攻之力。\n大富贵寿考，适然而莫必。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19919,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂咏十首 其八","author":"王季珠","text":"大造本无私，灵蠢合一族。\n君子受重名，幸有小人托。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19920,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂咏十首 其九","author":"王季珠","text":"识字忘仓颉，食粒昧后稷。\n大名名易朽，况乎小功业。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19921,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂咏十首 其十","author":"王季珠","text":"春花非一色，一色岂成春。\n同形不同性，何独疑于人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19922,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五十述怀二首 其一","author":"王季珠","text":"风涛未靖又兵戈，半百年从患难过。\n朋旧易飘霜后叶，老怀难起井中波。\n点金乏术成仙少，剪纸为花喝彩多。\n草草劳人干甚事，旷庐我只当行窝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19923,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五十述怀二首 其二","author":"王季珠","text":"苦摸心头也忒痴，布衣建树本无奇。\n卷舒在我天无恙，议论当官罪不知。\n一劫红羊尘外梦，十年黄鸟卷馀诗。\n犁锄入手真初学，老圃老农奉老师。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19924,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"旷庐遣兴二首 其一","author":"王季珠","text":"百年伟业付空谈，独有闲情不尽含。\n种德无功馀腐气，翻书有味比饴甘。\n崎岖路易欺疲马，继续丝还吐老蚕。\n近审中朝朋辈少，一枝春未递封函。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19925,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"旷庐遣兴二首 其二","author":"王季珠","text":"广厦难容况敝庐，古人未许赋同居。\n性缘傲物多多悔，交过中年渐渐疏。\n畏事竟成战败马，亡书直似放生鱼。\n花名载入群芳谱，近十年来考究虚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19926,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谒岳王观铁秦桧像二首 其一","author":"王季珠","text":"休提冤狱莫须有，但愿臣亡宋不亡。\n一片精忠千古鉴，槎枒松柏尽肝肠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19927,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谒岳王观铁秦桧像二首 其二","author":"王季珠","text":"谋害忠良罪莫饶，我为秦魄遣无聊。\n铁人亏得王前跪，臭气应由香火消。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19928,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"偕同人上韬光寺观春霭","author":"王季珠","text":"精气华光泄一胎，松篁绿霭拥楼台。\n山灵自写新图画，高向天空张挂来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19929,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乡情三首 其一","author":"王季珠","text":"太息吴农困莫苏，逐年遭歉逐年枯。\n屋防日漏又惊雨，家断鸡声况属猪。\n入市典衣完佛愿，待人聘女了官租。\n并非键户辞亲串，瓮倒床头酿已无。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19930,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乡情三首 其二","author":"王季珠","text":"似箭攒胸那放宽，形鸠面鹄总无颟。\n妇怜夫瘁忧成病，母听儿啼愿缩餐。\n寒暑劳人和药苦，米盐心计嚼梅酸。\n穷思饱暖真奇福，何处声腾百口欢。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19931,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乡情三首 其三","author":"王季珠","text":"嘉禾献瑞渺从前，新茧丰收不几年。\n闲语私逋肠欲裂，拟翻旧业肘多牵。\n善门纾难开平局，豪族追租押退田。\n叙及男婚女嫁事，破裘补不到完全。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19932,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"病起秋郊晚眺","author":"王季珠","text":"却因一疾免腾腾，人号予为有发僧。\n鉴水水怜容太弱，簪花花笑老无能。\n牛羊鞭入烟林画，蟋蟀催齐纺妇灯。\n渔艇稳依芦渚畔，收纶还待月东升。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19933,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"勖诸生二首 其一","author":"王季珠","text":"屹然学界极天高，拾级先登属我曹。\n角艺争能些小事，百年立脚要求牢。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19934,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"勖诸生二首 其二","author":"王季珠","text":"昔日私心期望处，身逢其境尽平常。\n吾人先入果何主，眼界胸襟两扩张。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19935,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"徐步","author":"王季珠","text":"徐步山隈与水隈，别无挂碍任徘徊。\n案头积有新诗料，半是沿途拾得来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19936,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"花朝二首 其一","author":"王季珠","text":"万虑皆灰惟有老，自知行径入空门。\n今朝欲鼓吟梅兴，急把枯肠酒一温。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19937,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"花朝二首 其二","author":"王季珠","text":"引我红愁却几株，放歌那说不关渠。\n花奴诗隶供闲遣，福分三生修到无。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19938,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"柬方蔚莪世弟","author":"王季珠","text":"青灯馀课读唐诗，生小钟情杜牧之。\n不省风流多罪戾，被花盗卖十年痴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19939,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"清明雨","author":"王季珠","text":"吾乡盛集昉何日，农具添新好助耕。\n四顾田塍真富丽，十分风雨败清明。\n冢虚麦饭鬼嗟馁，寺断香烟佛见轻。\n万户粮空求接济，孰关民瘼祷天晴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19940,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感时二首 其一","author":"王季珠","text":"示信于民第一程，如何刑偿半虚声。\n封疆吏易收成命，传舍官难达下情。\n选舞徵歌今干略，锦衣玉食世公卿。\n条陈百辈真心苦，可奈人微语已轻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19941,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感时二首 其二","author":"王季珠","text":"翎顶轩轩内外臣，坐看贼窟窜江滨。\n未谙韬略誇褒鄂，并荷恩荣渺越秦。\n劝学何篇真载道，理财无政不伤民。\n强支军国二三老，尚遣私人踞要津。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19942,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自遣","author":"王季珠","text":"医门累叶重高明，迄我偏忘问药名。\n五柳先生馀本色，三槐后裔忝家声。\n身经治乱四朝运，人与乾坤一气清。\n自揆何尝无分量，独怜修炼未能精。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19943,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苏邸还乡","author":"王季珠","text":"无风亦利小机轮，百里还家未隔晨。\n孙女要求科学本，老妻挖补秀才巾。\n流连鸡肋经商苦，逼胁膻风各界新。\n仅把乡音翻一二，亲朋疑我是苏人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19944,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初夏即景","author":"王季珠","text":"禹甸蓄馀春，花明楝子辰。\n麦瓜慈母禄，盐豆稚儿珍。\n蚕箔收邻户，牛车动隔津。\n腰镰期利用，先试伐荆榛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19945,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晒书","author":"王季珠","text":"一年一度秋阳好，日曝残编蠹不生。\n第恐英华收吸尽，令人无计用聪明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19946,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"柬曹岐鸣二首 其一","author":"王季珠","text":"作则原来在本身，君家和气盎如春。\n解纷排难孚忠信，不假言词折服人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19947,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"柬曹岐鸣二首 其二","author":"王季珠","text":"持斋戒杀佛为心，自奉何拌费一金。\n独有地方慈善事，随时施济总推襟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19948,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"田家杂咏十二首 其一","author":"王季珠","text":"菜甲将花一剪新，雨馀绿野辄周巡。\n烟林莺啭喜求友，香会蝉联重报亲。\n纸扎鸢鱼稚子巧，池苏螺蛤妇人仁。\n乡闾自古鲜文物，推大蓬蒿也有因。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19949,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"田家杂咏十二首 其二","author":"王季珠","text":"馀韵悠然放鸽铃，沿堤补柳类添丁。\n庭前飞舞杨花白，檐下啁啾竹叶青。\n双尾盐鱼供学究，一肩乌彘荐先灵。\n持家本系家翁主，妇女烦言未便听。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19950,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"田家杂咏十二首 其三","author":"王季珠","text":"团坐绳床莫我嫌，肺肝倾吐漫谦谦。\n为儿择日开关锁，阿母求神付吉签。\n新蚁芬芳初浸面，子鸡和淡薄楂盐。\n不奇桂辣椒辛味，知是吴民性喜甜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19951,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"田家杂咏十二首 其四","author":"王季珠","text":"一曲田歌绿树阴，涓涓流水听鸣琴。\n秧含时雨针针碧，麦受温风簇簇金。\n新制桔槔翻有样，古遗谣谵奉为箴。\n扫除爨下频敦嘱，失慎堪虞要小心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19952,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]